{'symbol': 'FFIV', 'date': '2022-09-21 07:00:00', 'title': 'F5 NAMED BEST IN CLASS FOR BOT MANAGEMENT IN AITE-NOVARICA MATRIX OF LEADING BOT DETECTION AND MANAGEMENT PROVIDERS', 'text': "SEATTLE--(BUSINESS WIRE)--F5 (NASDAQ: FFIV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT AITE-NOVARICA GROUP, A FINANCIAL SERVICES RESEARCH AND ADVISORY FIRM, HAS RANKED THE COMPANY AS A BEST IN CLASS PROVIDER OF BOT MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS IN THEIR RECENTLY RELEASED AITE MATRIX: LEADING BOT DETECTION AND MANAGEMENT PROVIDERS REPORT. AS A BEST IN CLASS VENDOR, F5'S APPROACH INTEGRATES BOT AND FRAUD DETECTION CAPABILITIES TO SECURE ORGANIZATIONS FROM A BREADTH OF AUTOMATED ATTACKS WHILE REDUCING USER FRICTION AND ALLOWING"}